 class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"coral-snake-medium\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Snake: <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-small\">Small Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large\">Large Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-small\">Small Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(19)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large\">Large Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d37b212af105279dd66e.webp\" alt=\"Coral Snake\"></div><h3>Coral Snake</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>12</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 8)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Snake</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>corrode · melee</td></tr>\